sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant R as ForumRoute
  participant S as ForumService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>R: POST /forum/posts
  R->>R: Zod 参数校验
  R->>S: createPost(userId, dto)
  S->>DB: 查询用户信用分和资料状态
  S->>S: 校验信用分、标题、正文、类型、图片
  S->>DB: 写 forum_posts / forum_post_images
  S->>S: 补充校验投票选项
  S->>DB: 如有投票则写 forum_poll_options
  DB-->>S: 返回 postId
  S-->>R: 发布成功
  R-->>U: 201 Created
